---
// Dark-only theme provider (replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider).
// The docs site has one theme, so it stores and reads nothing: no `starlight-theme`
// in localStorage (brand alignment brief 13.3; John, 25 Nov 2026). The inline script
// sets the theme before first paint, as Starlight's own provider does.
---

<script is:inline>document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';</script>
